### Use this file with VS Code REST Client extension by Huachao Mao to test the backend API
@base = http://localhost:3001

### Get all developers
GET {{base}}/api/developers

### Get all skills
GET {{base}}/api/skills

### Get all tasks
GET {{base}}/api/tasks

### Create a task that should be classified as Frontend
POST {{base}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "As a visitor, I want to see a responsive homepage so that I can easily navigate on both desktop and mobile devices."
}

### Create a task - Parent with unclassified subtasks
POST {{base}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "As a logged-in user, I want to update my profile information and upload a profile picture so that my account details are accurate and personalized.",
  "subtasks": [
    { "title": "As a visitor, I want to see a responsive homepage so that I can easily navigate on both desktop and mobile devices." },
    { "title": "As a system administrator, I want audit logs of all data access and modifications so that I can ensure compliance with data protection regulations and investigate any security incidents." }
  ]
}

### Assign Alice (Frontend only) — should fail with 400
PATCH {{base}}/api/tasks/1/assignee
Content-Type: application/json

{ "developerId": 1 }

### Assign Carol (both skills) — should succeed
PATCH {{base}}/api/tasks/1/assignee
Content-Type: application/json

{ "developerId": 3 }

### Mark done
PATCH {{base}}/api/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Done" }